	o It's REV 2. of PipeUtil.Library.
	o Tested, seems much faster too!

Version 093 Started : 16/11/93 Ended : 23/11/93 * Not Released *
-----------

	o PlFileCfg - New section, 'Baud Rates'. This section is
	   concerned with the CPS rates of the BPS rates.
	   It links a connection rate with the transfer time,
	   e.g. 2400 bps gets about 230cps, and 16800cps gets
           about 1850cps. It also allows you to chose whether
           users can Upload and Download with that Baud Rate or
           not.
	o BaudRates is no longer in 'PlFileCfg' but is a seperate
	   program. This is because it will have stuff relating to
	   Pipeline and PLMSG in it.
	o New flag in 'BaudRates', 'Allow Logon'. REXX Function
	   needs to accompany this.
	o Added some more autodocs in 'PipeUtil.Doc'.


