Version 0999
------------

	o Made it impossible for a deleted file to be accessed by
	   any file library functions.
	o Working FileRebuild - Now sorts all the files on disk.
	o PlFile no longer bubble-sorts the file list every time it
	   is run.
	o Two File Index Files -
		File:NewFiles.Ndx -=- contains any number of
			struct fileindex's, which are un-sorted.
		This file is sorted every time PlFile is run,
		but is incorporated into File:FilesNdx.Dat when
		FileRebuild is run. Therefore, FileRebuild should
		be run fairly often (every day preferably).
	o New Library function InsertNodeAlpha().

