Version 0.101
-------------

	o Written XenoFileConv. Utility to convert Xenolink 1.90
	File.Config files to Pipeline File Format.
	o Written DlgConvMailCfg and DlgConvFileCfg to convert DLG
	Configuration Files to Pipeline File Format.
	o Bug Fixed in PLFileEd. Illegal FreeMem if you enter PlFileEd,
	do not select a file, and quit.
	o SigEditor lets you remove areas by clicking it.
	o SIG Support Now Fully Completed.
	o New Scripts -> changesig.pl
	o New Commands -> ListSigs
                ChangeSig
	o Altered Commands -> ChangeArea "AreaNumber" [ALL]
In default state, ChangeArea will not allow you to change to a file areawhich
is not included in the SIG template the user has currently enabled. However,
this feature can be turned off by specifying ALL (for instance, if you want to
run a non-SIG system.
	o Altered Commands -> ListFileAreas [IGNORESIG]
Now lists the Areas which are specified in the current user's SIG template.
The IGNORESIG command ignores the current SIG selection and lists all the areas
the user has access to.
	o Altered Commands -> ChangeMsgArea, ListMsgAreas.
Same changes as their respective PLFILE counterparts.
	o New library functions -> GetSigList (). GetSig ().
SigEditor now can delete Entries (as previously mentioned).
	o Files cannot be marked more than once (cheers Martin).

