Version 0.112
------------

	o Upload and Download both now check for the Upload
	  directory (FilePath:Upload<Line>/) and create it if
	  not found.
	o Removed all inbuilt texts in program, and added tags
	  in the Language file. Marking files are now configurable,
	  as are flags in File Structures. See included
	  "Pipeline:Config/Language/Default.Nick"
	o Script 'MarkFiles.pl' re-written to look spammier.
	o ControlCodes %1010-%1013 now accept No. argument.
	o Fixed important bug. The File High Pointer was not
	  reset when PlFile is loaded, causing new files to be
	  created with Number '1'.
	o Through development work, it has been necessary to
	  delete file areas when they corrupted. This is unsatisfactory
	  because the file has several entries in various index files.
	  There is now a new program which deletes an entire
	  file area, removing with it every index entry that
	  the files in that area occupied.

	  DeleteFileArea AREA/A/N

	  Operates in four passes.
	  1) Removes the entries from the FileIndex main index.
	  2) Deletes FileDesc.Area file.
	  3) Deletes FileData.Area file.
	  4) Removes all related index entries from (A-#)-Index
	     files.
	o Changed the ENVARC:FileEditor structure to incorporate a
	  %s which is substituted for the filename.
	  Change your ENV:FileEditor file to say something like
          "Ced %s -keepio"
	o Both EDITORS and PLFILEED use ENV:FileEditor.

