	  made with "Add User"
	o Put base level file functions in a new library:
          "filebase.library" -> put in Zeus:Libs/
	o Improved FileConfig.
	o Added Multiple-path support.
	o Run ConvertFileBase: Zeus now supports 32-byte file names!
	o Fixed some fatal bugs in UED updating users.
	o Fixed bug in fbDeleteFile()
	o Sped up fbFileNameToNumber()
	o Added "Bulk Validate" to FileEditor (AB)
	o Removed 19-character limits from XFCC, FileEditor and
