	o Updated ZeusFile-Rexx.Doc. Complete listings of REXX
	  commands.
	o Fixed bugs in rxFileAreaToNumber, rxFileNumberToName,
	  rxFileNameToNumber
	o JumpFileArea now returns 5 at the end of the file areas,
	  and will skip past areas users may not access (instead
