	o Fixed illegal FreeMem in EndScanAreas
	o EndScanAreas may be called multiple times now.
	o Fixed bug in Zeus:Scripts/File/NewMarking & Download
	o Got those ratios doing it properly now :)
	o Fixed some nasties in FileRebuild
	o Rewrote GiveTemplates routine to be a lot faster.
	o Cleaned up AccessControl output.
	o Started fully documenting the File REXX commands.

