	o Rewrote FileConfig area list with new multimarking listview
	  routines.

	  Commands in FileConfig 
          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

	  Hitting [SHIFT] while clicking on the listview will multimark
	  an entry.

	  Various key commands are supported:

	  Cursor down  : Move current selection down.
	  Cursor up    : Move current selection up.
	  with SHIFT   : One page up/down
	  with ALT     : First/Last Item in list.
	  SPACE        : Mark/unmark selected item.

