	   "No Downloads Allowed".
	o SimpleList will no longer allow you to view areas which
	   have been set as "No Viewing Allowed".
	o Download does not alter file ratio data of free files.
	o Download saves the user data after last file has been sent.
	o SaveFile now sets FREEFILE if the file area has "Make
	   Files Free" set on and the file has no fake info. attached.
	o SaveFile returns -5 if "Dos File Names" is set on in the
	   file area, and the file name does not conform to the MS-DOS
	   8.3 file name standard.
	o Uploaded files will be marked as VALIDATED if "Validation
	   Required" is set to OFF in the file area configuration.
	o The General File Configuration is now held in
	   "Zeus:Config/File/General.Cfg".
	o New field in General File Configuration, "Temp Path", files
	   are copied to this directory first before downloading
	   if the "Copy to Temp" flag is set ON in the area.

