	o ARexx commands for UserEditor (port ZEUS):
		               UEDDisplayUser <Message>
                               UEDRequest <Message> <Buttons>
		CurrentAlias = UEDGetCurrentUserAlias
		CurrentName  = UEDGetCurrentUserName
		PubScreen    = UEDGetPublicScreen
		               UEDReloadUser
		               UEDReloadList
		               UEDThere
