	o New rexxMsgCommands/GetLocalEditor
	o Added menu file to FileEditor -> Zeus:Config/File/FileEditorMenus.Dat
	o Added lock message port to UserEditor.
	o Fixed small cosmetic in FileRebuild.
	o Added ARexx port to FileEditor.
                               FEDDisplayUser <Message>
                               FEDRequest <Message> <Buttons> <Title>
                AreaNumber   = FEDGetCurrentAreaNumber
                FileName     = FEDGetCurrentFileName <Ordinal Number from 1>
                FullPath     = FEDGetCurrentFullPath <Ordinal Number from 1>
		DosMode      = FEDInDosMode
                PubScreen    = FEDGetPublicScreen
                               FEDReloadFile
                               FEDReloadList
                FED Rexx?    = FEDThere
	o Rejigged Editors a little.
	o Added new fields to Prefs/Archivers:
		- Test, Passed, Failed.
	o Rejigged the Archivers configuration. You will need to re-edit your
	   configuration!
	o Fixed up the parse routines (RS).
	o Added TEST argument to GetArchiver.
	o New library function - ArchiverType( UBYTE *fn ) - does Recog stuff
	   and returns Archiver *
	o ConvMsgToText time fix.
	o New door "ArchiveManager <File Name> [TEST|EXTRACT <Files>] [DIRECTORY <Dir>]", returns:
	   0 - Operation Successful
	   1 - Operation Failed
	   5 - Could not recognise file
	   10- Could not open file
           15- Could not change directory
	   20- Fatal error
	  This door provides a standard interface to the archivers via. the
	  Prefs/Archivers configuration.
	o Added General File Config and Archivers to UpdateConfigs.


